{"id":"774a7723667e1813","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-truth-set.md","title":"Truth Set","display":"df-truth-set — Truth Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-truth-set","aliases":["89-df-truth-set","truth set","真值集"],"display":"df-truth-set — Truth Set","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-world]]","[[89-df-truth-at-world]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-truth-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-truth-set</span><span>truth set</span><span>真值集</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-set — Truth Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"edcd1eb132936613\" href=\"?note=edcd1eb132936613\" title=\"89-df-world\">89-df-world</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"920317161a2cce71\" href=\"?note=920317161a2cce71\" title=\"89-df-truth-at-world\">89-df-truth-at-world</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-set-—-Truth-Set-$\\varphi$\">df-truth-set — Truth Set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\varphi]\">\\([\\varphi]\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)\">\\(\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)\\)</span> (Kripke model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n[\\varphi]_{\\mathcal{M}}\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in W\\mid\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\varphi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n[\\varphi]_{\\mathcal{M}}\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in W\\mid\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\varphi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\varphi]_{\\mathcal{M}}\">\\([\\varphi]_{\\mathcal{M}}\\)</span> : 公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 在模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}\\)</span> 中的真值集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\varphi]\">\\([\\varphi]\\)</span> : 真值集（简化表示）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真值集直观地表示公式在模型中的&quot;范围&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>真值集展示公式在哪些世界中真</li>\n<li>真值集提供公式的&quot;分布&quot;信息</li>\n<li>真值集可用于分析模型结构</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真值集的基本性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[p] = V(p)\">\\([p] = V(p)\\)</span>（原子公式）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\neg \\varphi] = W \\setminus [\\varphi]\">\\([\\neg \\varphi] = W \\setminus [\\varphi]\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\varphi \\land \\psi] = [\\varphi] \\cap [\\psi]\">\\([\\varphi \\land \\psi] = [\\varphi] \\cap [\\psi]\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\Box \\varphi]_{\\mathcal M}=\n\\{w\\in W\\mid\\forall v\\in W,(wRv\\to\nv\\in[\\varphi]_{\\mathcal M})\\}\">\\([\\Box \\varphi]_{\\mathcal M}=\n\\{w\\in W\\mid\\forall v\\in W,(wRv\\to\nv\\in[\\varphi]_{\\mathcal M})\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>真值集的代数性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>真值集构成布尔代数（关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg, \\land, \\lor\">\\(\\neg, \\land, \\lor\\)</span>）</li>\n<li>模态算子是代数上的运算</li>\n</ul>\n<p>特殊真值集：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\top] = W\">\\([\\top] = W\\)</span>（恒真公式）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\bot] = \\emptyset\">\\([\\bot] = \\emptyset\\)</span>（恒假公式）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 在固定模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> 上有效当且仅当\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\varphi]_{\\mathcal M}=W\">\\([\\varphi]_{\\mathcal M}=W\\)</span>；普遍有效还要求该等式对所有模型成立。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"920317161a2cce71\" href=\"?note=920317161a2cce71\" title=\"89-df-truth-at-world\">89-df-truth-at-world</a>：真值集的基本元素</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a>：全真公式有真值集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span></li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f233d5485efaad7c\" href=\"?note=f233d5485efaad7c\" title=\"89-df-bisimulation\">89-df-bisimulation</a>：双模拟保持真值集</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"40431653a082dc65\" href=\"?note=40431653a082dc65\" title=\"89-prop-truth-set-modal\">89-prop-truth-set-modal</a>：真值集的模态性质</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参考文献：Boolos, George. <em>The Logic of Provability</em>. Chapter 2.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-set-—-Truth-Set-$\\varphi$","text":"df-truth-set — Truth Set $[\\varphi]$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]",